{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Yeah that sounds like potions of healing should *also* be part of the inventory.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:26:24.211000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869450631709069363","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"You're right, Finn and I have been so preoccupied with grabbing explosives and ammunition we never thought about it much.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:27:21.410000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869450871619092491","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I'd join you but, I'm not cut out for that work. Maybe one day, but I'm best used where I can keep the back logs going. Keeping this place running and funds moving is important\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:28:06.622000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869451061251964968","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Maybe some potions of flying for bombing purposes, maybe scrolls of web if anyone can use them. Did you know webs are *really* flammable?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:28:30.855000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869451162892529684","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
