{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"And hey, can imagine. My people are just active during night time mostly, and couldn't really get up on the front lines with others much. But, I suppose it's also perfect time to prepare some inventory for the main team.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:30:17.135000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869451608663138345","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"It'd definitely be useful. I'm not sure we have enough essence around here to make enough of it though.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:30:40.308000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869451705857757184","reply_to_id":"869451162892529684","thread":null,"thread_id":null}
