{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Say, Willow. You've been in Kingsbridge a lot with Ravens business. Do you maybe know which part of the borough seems to be like the oldest one? Would it be somewhere around the lamplighters' or the grove, or already out in the Noir?\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:37:58.502000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869453543776604170","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"harpy","id":"651981368175230976","is_bot":0,"username":"harpsy_cored"},"author_id":"651981368175230976","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"I don't know.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:38:12.810000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869453603788705853","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Gotcha. I suppose I'll check with the 'lighters later too, if they're not busy. Or maybe I'll find some hope on my own, who knows.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:39:25.747000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869453909708656681","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Probably Manhattan and a bit of Kingsbridge. Manhattan has the tallest buildings and started with the epicenter\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:39:30.616000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869453930130714704","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Versil","id":"148682928434577408","is_bot":0,"username":"versil"},"author_id":"148682928434577408","channel_id":"863743873411317800","content":"\"Oh, not the whole Empire City. Its oldest part would be in Hamp as far as I can tell. Mostly curious about Kingsbridge on its own.\"","created_at":"2021-07-27T05:40:36.347000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"869454205826514944","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
